| Layer          | Recommendation                       | Why                                                                 |
| -------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Frontend       | Next.js + React                      | Fast, SEO-friendly, excellent ecosystem                             |
| Styling        | Tailwind CSS                         | Rapid, consistent UI development                                    |
| Backend        | Supabase                             | Authentication, database, storage, and security in one platform     |
| Authentication | Google OAuth + magic links           | Easy sign-in with minimal friction                                  |
| Database       | PostgreSQL (via Supabase)            | Reliable relational database for listings, users, jobs, and content |
| File Storage   | Supabase Storage                     | Photos, documents, logos                                            |
| Maps           | Google Maps or Mapbox                | Business locations and search                                       |
| Search         | Meilisearch                          | Fast, typo-tolerant traditional search                              |
| AI Search      | OpenAI Responses API + vector search | Natural-language answers grounded in your own content               |
| Payments       | Stripe                               | Premium listings and subscriptions                                  |
| Email          | Resend                               | Transactional emails                                                |
| Monitoring     | Sentry                               | Error tracking and performance                                      |
| Analytics      | Plausible or Google Analytics        | Privacy-friendly or industry standard                               |
| Hosting        | Vercel                               | Optimized deployment for Next.js                                    |
